{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13590","headline":"寄题杜拾遗锦江野亭 · 严武","name":"寄题杜拾遗锦江野亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"漫向江头把钓竿，懒眠沙草爱风湍。\n莫倚善题鹦鹉赋，何须不着鵕鸃冠。\n腹中书籍幽时晒，肘後医方静处看。\n兴发会能驰骏马，应须直到使君滩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"严武","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13590.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13590","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《杜诗详注》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/杜詩詳註_(四庫全書本)）"}